powers granted by forest spirits and enchanted animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice changes how you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439460/extras/6234ec5d4c07b2d1dddd8e5f6ababe85.poster.avif?t=1786703921\" width=896 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439460/extras/6234ec5d4c07b2d1dddd8e5f6ababe85.webm?t=1786703921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439460/extras/6234ec5d4c07b2d1dddd8e5f6ababe85.mp4?t=1786703921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THERE IS NO BALANCE WITHOUT A FIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human greed leaves deep scars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corrupted creatures roam the forest, and the natural balance has been broken. Rescue animals, purify areas overtaken by destruction, and strengthen the forest with elemental powers, spiritual rituals, and the help of ancestral entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave no invader standing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME THE GUARDIAN OF NHE'ERY, THE ATLANTIC FOREST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TURI KAAPORA is a journey about resistance, identity, and connection with nature, where fighting is surviving. The forest resists. The forest fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now, it fights through you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the development of TURI KAAPORA on our social media and be part of this journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "Nature strikes back. TURI KAAPORA is a Hack n’ Slash inspired by Indigenous South American mythology. Become Kaapora and destroy men and machine to defend your homeland.", "supported_languages